Subject: [PATCH] jasmine-j0115: Adreno 512 idle power, on by default: hardware
 clock gating (kgsl's a512 table; sweetgpucg=0 off) and GX collapse after an
 80 ms idle hold and with the display off, resume in the submit path or on
 touch/keys/display on (sweetgpupc=0|1|2, default 1; _hold=, _cx=); command
 port gpu pc, gpu cg; batt icl MA SECS (temporary low USB input limit for
 fuel-gauge A/B)

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
