+/*
+ * Idle power (j0115, jasmine/GPU-IDLE-POWER.md): hardware clock gating while
+ * the GPU is on, GX collapse after hold ms without a submit and right after
+ * display off, resume in the submit path (or earlier, on touch, keys and
+ * display on). on, cx_low and the counters change under gpu_lock.
